# What the scripts here make again, left out as the other assets leave it out: the concept scenes and their raw renders
# and check pictures (build_stations.py and its finishing scripts make them), the materials' check pictures, construction
# fields and 2,048 sets (build_material.py makes them; the game reads the 1,024 sets), and the snaps as PNG (kept as JPEG).
*.blend
*.blend1
ref/concept-*/renders/
ref/concept-*/checks/*.png
tex/*/checks/
tex/*/source/*.npz
tex/*/*_base.png
tex/*/*_height.png
tex/*/*_normal.png
tex/*/*_orm.png
ref/game/*.png
